# Example only — see docs/CONFIG.md
name: metal-mirage-shared
runtime: go
description: Traffic Manager failover + optional witness Function
# Required:
#   pulumi config set shared:primaryIngressIP '<primary ingress public IP>'
# If witness enabled (default):
#   pulumi config set shared:primaryAPIURL 'https://<api-ip>:6443/readyz'
# Optional:
#   pulumi config set shared:standbyFQDN '<aks fqdn>'
#   pulumi config set shared:enableWitness false
#   pulumi config set shared:witnessLocation westus2   # if Y1 quota is 0 in eastus (replaces existing witness SA/plan/app)
#   pulumi config set --secret shared:failoverWebhookURL 'https://…'  # optional notify
#   pulumi config set --secret shared:failoverWebhookHMACSecret '…'   # optional X-Metal-Mirage-Signature
#   pulumi config set shared:failoverGitHubRepo 'OWNER/metal-mirage'   # optional repository_dispatch
#   pulumi config set --secret shared:failoverGitHubToken 'github_pat_…'  # fine-grained: Contents R/W on that repo only
# Prefer: ./scripts/up.sh shared  (wires outputs from primary/standby)
# Auto-promote modes: docs/AUTO-FAILOVER.md
# TM Azure names: profile metal-mirage-app, endpoints primary / standby
